  "title": "Bodybuilder vs Machhar — Size Does Not Matter",
  "story": "A tiny mosquito interrupts a proud bodybuilder in the park. He flexes to scare it. It lands on his right cheek: he slaps himself, missing the bug. It lands on the left: another self-slap. He tries trapping it with both hands near his nose, but it escapes. A giant sneeze also fails. The mosquito returns untouched; his muscles deflate in defeat and he runs away. The tiny mosquito takes over the close-up, then buzzes back toward the opening position.",
